# STATION 3: text input, Enter key, interpolation, string comparison, plural().
npc: @test_input
title: Station 3 - Text input
speaker: Tester

== start
TEST 3: Text input. You will be asked to type. Try pressing Enter as well as clicking OK.
<<input $tmp.word "Type any word and press Enter (or OK)">>
<<if $tmp.word == "">>
  You submitted an empty box. Expected: this message, then the menu.
<<else>>
  You typed "{$tmp.word}". Expected: your text echoed exactly, including capitals and spaces.
<<endif>>
<<input $tmp.n "Now type a number">>
You typed {$tmp.n}, which reads as {plural($tmp.n, "apple", "apples")}: "{$tmp.n} {plural($tmp.n, "apple", "apples")}".
-> Try again
    <<jump start>>
-> Leave
    <<end>>
